Package: binutils-arm-rtems4.7
Section: devel
Architecture: any
Priority: extra
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends} 
Suggests: binutils (>= ${Source-Version})
Description: Binary utilities that support ARM/RTEMS targets.
 The programs in this package are used to manipulate binary and object
 files that may have been created for ARM architecture.  This package
 is primarily for ARM developers and cross-compilers and is not needed
 by normal users or developers.
